\] Multiplication by \(h(t)=t-t_c\) is the inverse map, from \(c_{47}+4\) to \(c_{47}\). Both directions extend by the local argument in P3F.21. Parameter-independent changes of the ordinary frame add the same term to the two origins below and cancel in their difference.

\item On \(q=Q_0^4\), take the two explicit origins \[
